problem: Cargo.lock was modified and needed to be committed without including unrelated files
approach: Verified repo status showed only Cargo.lock changed, committed just Cargo.lock, then pushed the branch and commit note
failed_paths:
  - None
verification:
  - git status --short
  - git diff --stat -- Cargo.lock
  - git show --stat --oneline HEAD -- Cargo.lock
  - git notes show HEAD
workflow_learning: For isolated lockfile updates, verify the worktree first and commit only Cargo.lock to avoid bundling unrelated changes
related_files:
  - Cargo.lock
